<title>FRANCE: France to sell 18 to 20 bln Ffr of BTANs Thursday.</title>
<headline>France to sell 18 to 20 bln Ffr of BTANs Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>France is to offer between 18 and 20 billion francs of Treasury notes (BTANs) at its next auction on Thursday, the Treasury said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>On offer will be the 4.75 percent April 1999 BTAN and the 4.50 percent July 2002 BTAN.</p>
<p>Payment date for both lines is August 28.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 42 21 54 52</p>
</text>
